Package: orderridge
Title: Order-Adaptive Ridge Estimation for Factorial Response Surfaces
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Molly", "Offer-Westort", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "mollyow@gmail.com")
Description: Constructs target-distribution-weighted factorial function spaces,
    estimates dense response surfaces with order-specific ridge penalties, and
    provides cross-fitted randomization-based inference for prespecified linear
    factorial estimands. The implementation penalizes functions rather than
    reference-coded coefficients and supports monotone or unrestricted penalties.
